---
import {adminConfigured} from '../../lib/server';
const enabled=adminConfigured();
---
<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>관리자 로그인 · R9700 Hub</title></head><body><main><a href="/">← R9700 Hub</a><h1>운영 관리</h1><p>수집·개선·홍보의 상태를 확인하고 필요한 설정을 관리합니다.</p>{enabled?<form id="login"><label for="password">관리자 비밀번호</label><input id="password" type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required minlength="16"/><button>로그인</button></form>:<aside>관리자 기능을 활성화하려면 서버의 ADMIN_PASSWORD(16자 이상)와 SESSION_SECRET(32자 이상)을 설정하세요. 기본 비밀번호는 제공하지 않습니다.</aside>}<p id="message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></main><script>document.querySelector('#login')?.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const form=e.target as HTMLFormElement;const message=document.querySelector('#message')!;const button=form.querySelector('button')!;button.disabled=true;try{const response=await fetch('/api/login',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({password:new FormData(form).get('password')})});const result=await response.json();if(result.ok)location.assign('/admin');else message.textContent=result.error;}catch{message.textContent='연결을 확인하세요.';}finally{button.disabled=false;}});</script><style>body{margin:0;background:#f5f3ee;color:#202320;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:440px;margin:12vh auto;padding:32px}a{color:#505a50}h1{font-size:32px}p,aside{line-height:1.7}form{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:32px}input,button{font:inherit;padding:14px;border:1px solid #b9bdb3;border-radius:5px}button{background:#283a2d;color:white;cursor:pointer}aside{padding:20px;background:#e9e9df;border-left:3px solid #6c7666}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b8573c;outline-offset:3px}</style></body></html>
